  "tier": "culture",
  "titles": {
    "_tiers_note": "Toltec-style Maya-Nahua fusion, ascending. The Nahuatl tlatoani ladder over a Maya substrate, so lords bear blended styles: Nakom (Maya war-captain) march, Ajaw (Maya lord) county, and the divine king is the K'uhul Tlatoani (holy-speaker - Maya k'uhul + Nahua tlatoani) at principality. Tlatoani (city-king) duchy; Hueyi Tlatoani (great speaker) kingdom; Cem-Anahuac Tlatoani (ruler of all) empire; Tecuhtli (lord) barony. The Plumed-Serpent throne (the Toltec legacy) legitimizes the line. (Rank titles are the real Nahuatl/Maya register, allowed.)",
    "female_forms": {
      "Ajaw": "Ix-Ajaw",
      "Cem-Anahuac Tlatoani": "Cem-Anahuac Cihuatlatoani",
      "Hueyi Tlatoani": "Hueyi Cihuatlatoani",
      "K'uhul Tlatoani": "Ix-K'uhul Cihuatlatoani",
      "Nakom": "Ix-Nakom",
      "Tecuhtli": "Cihuatecuhtli",
      "Tlatoani": "Cihuatlatoani"
    },
